WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.517 --> 00:00:01.493
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:03.877 --> 00:00:06.591
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi. Where are you from?

3
00:00:06.735 --> 00:00:10.181
<v><b>B:</b></v> We’re from Recife, in Brazil.

4
00:00:10.339 --> 00:00:13.671
<v><b>A:</b></v> OK. Good luck to the Brazilian team!

5
00:00:14.001 --> 00:00:15.466
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you!

6
00:00:18.439 --> 00:00:19.257
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

7
00:00:20.995 --> 00:00:25.691
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hello. I’m Mike from UK News. Where are you from?

8
00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:27.529
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m from Australia.

9
00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:28.893
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you from Sydney?

10
00:00:29.123 --> 00:00:32.418
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m not. I’m from Cairns.

11
00:00:32.447 --> 00:00:35.341
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where’s Cairns? Is it near Sydney?

12
00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:40.848
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, it isn’t. It’s in the north. Am I on TV?

13
00:00:40.869 --> 00:00:42.004
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, you are.

14
00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.122
<v><b>B:</b></v> Wow!

15
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.471
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

16
00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.808
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi. Are you German?

17
00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:57.068
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, we aren’t. We’re from Switzerland.

18
00:00:57.283 --> 00:00:58.892
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh, sorry!